   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.05,
    "end": 6.13,
    "text": "This is why you don't ever want to touch the receipts on thermal paper"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 11.77,
    "end": 15.17,
    "text": "These thermal paper receipts contain BPA and BPS"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 15.53,
    "end": 20.25,
    "text": "These are endocrine disrupting chemicals that can actually be absorbed through your skin"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 20.29,
    "end": 23.73,
    "text": "So just touching one of the grocery store every once in a while isn't the end of the world"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 23.73,
    "end": 28.37,
    "text": "But I would like to avoid as many endocrine disruptors in my life. Thank you as I can"
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 28.37,
    "end": 35.73,
    "text": "So I either don't get the receipt or I'm just going to use my handy-dandy wool shirt here to put the receipt in the trash"
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 36.33,
    "end": 37.77,
    "text": "And not touch it"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 37.77,
    "end": 40.45,
    "text": "So if you are touching a lot of receipts or in your daily life"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 40.57,
    "end": 44.49,
    "text": "Don't touch the thermal paper receipts and you will decrease your exposure"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 45.05,
    "end": 50.85,
    "text": "VPA and VPS endocrine deceptive chemicals that can be messing up your hormones. Don't touch them"
   }
  ]
 },
